{"title": "Maintenance chat experiment", "summary": "An opt-in modern chat view of the real Maintenance worker: rich Markdown and HTML previews, shared persistent history, stack review and terminal handoff. Tested with 481 tests, typecheck, builds and desktop/mobile browser checks.", "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Maintenance chat experiment</title><style>\n:root{--ink:#2b2d42;--paper:#fffaf0;--paper-2:#f3ebe0;--muted:#6b7484;--good:#2a9d4b}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f7eddc;color:#2b2d42;font:15px system-ui;padding:26px}main{max-width:1200px;margin:auto}h1{font-size:32px;margin:8px 0}p{line-height:1.5}a{color:#4564c7}.tag{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700}.intro{max-width:760px}.switch{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fffaf0;border:2px solid #2b2d42;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin:18px 0}.hidden{display:none!important}.modal{display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}.stage .maintenance-chat{width:100%;height:760px;max-height:none}.classic{max-width:640px;margin:32px auto;border:3px solid #2b2d42;box-shadow:0 6px #2b2d42;border-radius:20px;background:#fffaf0;padding:22px}.classic textarea{width:100%;min-height:150px;border:3px solid #2b2d42;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;font:15px system-ui}.classic button{background:#ffd166;border:2px solid #2b2d42;border-radius:12px;padding:10px;font-weight:800}.evidence{background:#fffaf0;border:2px solid #2b2d42;border-radius:16px;padding:20px;margin:26px 0}.badges{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.badges span{padding:6px 12px;background:#def0e6;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px}.overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#17212f90;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:20px;z-index:90}.overlay section{background:white;color:#27344a;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;max-width:560px;width:100%}.overlay button{float:right;border:1px solid #dce1e8;background:white;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}.overlay pre{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#182132;color:#dce5f5;border-radius:8px;padding:18px}.demo-note{font-size:12px;color:#6b7484}@media(max-width:700px){body{padding:12px}.stage .maintenance-chat{height:800px;max-height:none}h1{font-size:27px}}\n.md { padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n.md > :first-child { margin-top: 0; }\n.md > :last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n.md p, .md ul, .md ol, .md blockquote, .md pre, .md table, .md details { margin: 0 0 12px; }\n.md h1, .md h2, .md h3, .md h4, .md h5, .md h6 { margin: 20px 0 8px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.25; }\n.md h1 { font-size: 22px; padding-bottom: 5px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(43, 45, 66, .12); }\n.md h2 { font-size: 19px; padding-bottom: 4px; border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(43, 45, 66, .12); }\n.md h3 { font-size: 16.5px; }\n.md h4 { font-size: 15px; }\n.md h5, .md h6 { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }\n.md strong { font-weight: 900; }\n.md a { color: #1d6fd6; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }\n.md a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n.md code { font: 12.5px ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; background: #f3ebe0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 1px 5px; }\n.md pre { background: #1e1f2e; color: #e9ecef; border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; overflow: auto; }\n.md pre code { background: none; padding: 0; color: inherit; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.5; }\n.md blockquote { margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 2px 14px; border-left: 4px solid #d9cbb8; color: var(--muted); }\n.md ul, .md ol { padding-left: 26px; }\n.md li + li { margin-top: 3px; }\n.md li > ul, .md li > ol, .md li > p { margin: 4px 0; }\n.md li:has(> input[type=checkbox]) { list-style: none; margin-left: -20px; }\n.md input[type=checkbox] { margin: 0 6px 0 0; vertical-align: -2px; accent-color: var(--good); }\n.md table { display: block; width: max-content; max-width: 100%; overflow: auto; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13.5px; }\n.md th, .md td { border: 1.5px solid #ddd0bf; padding: 6px 11px; text-align: left; }\n.md th { background: var(--paper-2); font-weight: 900; }\n.md tr:nth-child(2n) td { background: #fffaf3; }\n.md img { max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; }\n.md hr { border: 0; border-top: 2px dashed #ddd0bf; margin: 18px 0; }\n.md details { border: 2px solid #ebe1d4; border-radius: 10px; padding: 6px 12px; }\n.md details[open] > summary { margin-bottom: 6px; }\n.md summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 800; }\n.md kbd { font: 11.5px ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); border-bottom-width: 3px; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0 5px; background: #fff; }\n.md .none { color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; }\n.md a.mention, .md a.ref { font-weight: 800; }\n.md blockquote.alert { color: var(--ink); border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; padding: 8px 14px; }\n.md .alert-title { font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 2px; }\n.md .alert.note { border-color: #1d6fd6; background: #eaf3ff; }\n.md .alert.tip { border-color: #2a9d4b; background: #e6f8ec; }\n.md .alert.important { border-color: #9d4edd; background: #f3e8ff; }\n.md .alert.warning { border-color: #e0a100; background: #fff6d6; }\n.md .alert.caution { border-color: #c3423f; background: #ffebee; }\n/* The experimental Maintenance client uses a quiet, modern surface rather than office props. */\n.modal.maintenance-chat { width: min(1200px, 100%); max-width: 100%; min-width: 0; height: min(850px, 90dvh); max-height: 90dvh; padding: 0; border: 1px solid #dce1e8; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 24px 80px #11182740; background: #fff; color: #202938; overflow: hidden; font: 14px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; animation: none; }\n.maintenance-chat button, .maintenance-chat input, .maintenance-chat textarea { font: inherit; color: inherit; border: 1px solid #dce1e8; border-radius: 8px; background: #fff; box-shadow: none; }\n.maintenance-chat button { padding: 7px 12px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 500; }\n.maintenance-chat button:hover { background: #f0f3f7; }\n.maintenance-chat button:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: default; }\n.maintenance-chat :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #5571dc; outline-offset: 2px; }\n.maintenance-chat > header { background: #fff; padding: 20px 24px; margin: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e7eaf0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }\n.maintenance-chat > header h2 { font-size: 22px; margin: 2px 0; font-weight: 650; }\n.maintenance-experiment { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #6374a4; font-weight: 650; }\n.maintenance-chat-status { color: #6b7484; font-size: 12px; }\n.maintenance-chat-tools { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }\n.maintenance-chat .close { position: static; }\n.maintenance-chat-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 250px minmax(0, 1fr); flex: 1; min-height: 0; }\n.maintenance-chat aside { padding: 20px 12px; background: #f7f8fb; border-right: 1px solid #e7eaf0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-height: 0; }\n.maintenance-chat aside h3 { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 4px 0; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; }\n.maintenance-chat aside small { color: #788193; font-size: 11px; margin: 0 4px; }\n.maintenance-chat aside input { width: 100%; padding: 8px 10px; }\n.maintenance-chat-archive { overflow-y: auto; min-height: 0; }\n.maintenance-chat .maintenance-conversation { display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; background: transparent; border: 0; margin: 4px 0; }\n.maintenance-conversation b { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }\n.maintenance-chat .maintenance-conversation.selected { background: #e8edf9; color: #3b5293; }\n.maintenance-archive-empty { color: #788193; font-size: 12px; padding: 10px; }\n.maintenance-chat-main { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 0; min-width: 0; }\n.maintenance-chat-messages { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 26px; scroll-behavior: auto; }\n.maintenance-message { margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 94%; }\n.maintenance-message.from-user { margin-left: auto; max-width: 85%; }\n.maintenance-message-meta { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; font-size: 11px; color: #8490a2; margin: 0 4px 6px; }\n.maintenance-message-meta b { font-weight: 600; color: #526074; }\n.from-user .maintenance-message-meta { justify-content: flex-end; }\n.maintenance-bubble { border: 1px solid #e7eaf0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 18px; background: #fafbfc; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n.from-user .maintenance-bubble { background: #eef2ff; border-color: #e0e7ff; }\n.maintenance-user-text { white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0; }\n.maintenance-chat .md { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.65; }\n.maintenance-chat .md > :first-child { margin-top: 0; }\n.maintenance-chat .md > :last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n.maintenance-chat .md h1, .maintenance-chat .md h2, .maintenance-chat .md h3 { color: #27344a; font-weight: 650; }\n.maintenance-chat .md pre { position: relative; background: #182132; color: #dce5f5; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 36px 14px 14px; white-space: pre; overflow: auto; }\n.maintenance-chat .md table { display: block; overflow-x: auto; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%; }\n.maintenance-chat .md td, .maintenance-chat .md th { border: 1px solid #dce1e8; padding: 8px 12px; }\n.maintenance-chat .md a { color: #4564c7; }\n.maintenance-chat .maintenance-copy { position: absolute; right: 8px; top: 6px; font-size: 11px; color: #dce5f5; background: #27344a; border: 0; padding: 3px 8px; }\n.maintenance-preview { margin: 14px 0; }\n.maintenance-preview summary { cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; color: #4564c7; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.maintenance-html { display: block; width: 100%; height: 320px; border: 1px solid #dce1e8; border-radius: 8px; background: #fff; }\n.maintenance-chat-empty { max-width: 440px; margin: 60px auto; color: #788193; text-align: center; }\n.maintenance-chat-empty h3 { font-size: 24px; color: #354259; font-weight: 600; }\n.maintenance-chat-composer { padding: 16px 24px; border-top: 1px solid #e7eaf0; background: #fff; }\n.maintenance-chat-composer textarea { width: 100%; min-height: 70px; max-height: 180px; resize: vertical; padding: 12px; }\n.maintenance-composer-bottom { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: 8px; }\n.maintenance-composer-note { color: #788193; font-size: 11px; margin: 0; }\n.maintenance-chat .maintenance-send { background: #4564c7; color: #fff; border-color: #4564c7; padding: 8px 20px; }\n.maintenance-chat-error { color: #a13143; background: #fff1f2; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 0 10px; }\n.maintenance-chat .maintenance-older { margin: 8px auto 0; font-size: 12px; }\n@media (max-width: 700px) {\n  .modal.maintenance-chat { width: 100%; height: 94dvh; max-height: 94dvh; }\n  .maintenance-chat > header { background: #fff; padding: 12px; }\n  .maintenance-chat-tools { gap: 4px; }\n  .maintenance-chat-tools button { font-size: 11px; padding: 6px; }\n  .maintenance-chat-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-rows: 160px minmax(0, 1fr); }\n  .maintenance-chat aside { padding: 10px; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e7eaf0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; }\n  .maintenance-chat aside h3, .maintenance-chat aside > small { display: none; }\n  .maintenance-chat-archive { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n  .maintenance-chat-messages { padding: 16px 12px; }\n  .maintenance-chat-composer { padding: 12px; }\n  .maintenance-message, .maintenance-message.from-user { max-width: 100%; }\n}\n\n.maintenance-chat .md details { border: 0; padding: 0; background: transparent; box-shadow: none; }\n.maintenance-chat .md summary { font-weight: 500; }\n.maintenance-chat .md a { font-weight: 500; }\n.maintenance-chat .md code { background: #edf0f5; }\n.maintenance-chat .md pre code { background: none; }\n.maintenance-chat .md th { background: #f0f3f7; font-weight: 600; }\n.maintenance-chat .md tr:nth-child(2n) td { background: #f8f9fb; }\n\n.maintenance-chat > header > div:first-child { min-width: 0; }\n@media (max-width: 700px) { .maintenance-chat > header h2 { font-size: 18px; } }\n</style><main><div class=\"tag\">AGENT OFFICE \u00b7 MAINTENANCE STACK</div><h1>A modern way to talk to Maintenance.</h1><p class=\"intro\">The real worker, a richer conversation view, and history that stays in the office. This is an opt-in experiment; requests still build changes on the maintenance stack.</p><label class=\"switch\"><input id=\"experiment\" type=\"checkbox\" checked> Settings \u2192 Experiments \u2192 Maintenance chat</label><p class=\"demo-note\">Interactive prototype with synthetic conversations. Toggle the experiment, search the archive, preview HTML, or send a demo message. Nothing here contacts a worker or ships the stack.</p><div class=\"stage\"><div class=\"modal maintenance-chat\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Maintenance chat experiment\"><header><div><span class=\"maintenance-experiment\">EXPERIMENT</span><h2>Maintenance</h2><span class=\"maintenance-chat-status\">working \u00b7 Agent Office</span></div><div class=\"maintenance-chat-tools\"><button type=\"button\">Review stack</button><button type=\"button\">Open terminal</button><button class=\"close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close Maintenance chat\">\u2715</button></div></header><div class=\"maintenance-chat-layout\"><aside><button class=\"maintenance-current\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Current conversation</button><h3>Conversation archive</h3><small>Shared with the office \u00b7 saved across restarts</small><input type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search conversations\" aria-label=\"Search Maintenance history\" style=\"\"><div class=\"maintenance-chat-archive\"><button class=\"maintenance-conversation selected\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><b>Build a modern Maintenance chat view</b><small>10/1/2026 \u00b7 4 messages</small></button><button class=\"maintenance-conversation\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><b>Fix the Shift shortcut hint</b><small>9/30/2026 \u00b7 2 messages</small></button></div></aside><section class=\"maintenance-chat-main\"><button class=\"maintenance-older hidden\" type=\"button\">Load earlier messages</button><div class=\"maintenance-chat-messages\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Maintenance conversation\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions\" data-thread=\"maintenance\"><article class=\"maintenance-message from-user\" data-message=\"u1\"><div class=\"maintenance-message-meta\"><b>Alex</b><time datetime=\"2026-10-01T12:00:00.000Z\">12:00 PM</time></div><div class=\"maintenance-bubble\"><p class=\"maintenance-user-text\">Build a modern Maintenance chat view with Markdown, HTML previews, and a saved archive.</p></div></article><article class=\"maintenance-message from-agent\" data-message=\"a1\"><div class=\"maintenance-message-meta\"><b>Maintenance</b><time datetime=\"2026-10-01T12:00:00.000Z\">12:00 PM</time></div><div class=\"maintenance-bubble\"><div class=\"md\"><h2>A clearer way to work</h2>\n<p>The experimental view is ready for review.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Format</th>\n<th>Rendering</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Markdown</td>\n<td>Tables, lists, links and code</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTML</td>\n<td>Isolated, styled preview</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><input checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" style=\"\"> Persistent office archive</li>\n<li><input checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\" style=\"\"> Terminal access for approvals</li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">const experimentalChat = true;\n</code><button class=\"maintenance-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;div style=\"padding:22px;background:#eef2ff;border-radius:12px;color:#334c9b;font:16px system-ui\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;HTML preview&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Agent layouts keep their styling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n</code><button class=\"maintenance-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\">Copy</button></pre><details class=\"maintenance-preview\"><summary>Preview HTML</summary><iframe class=\"maintenance-html\" title=\"Agent HTML preview\" sandbox=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" srcdoc=\"&lt;meta http-equiv=&quot;Content-Security-Policy&quot; content=&quot;default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; font-src data:; connect-src 'none'; form-action 'none'; base-uri 'none';&quot;&gt;&lt;style&gt;body{font:15px system-ui;color:#17212f;margin:20px}pre{white-space:pre-wrap}&lt;/style&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:22px;background:#eef2ff;border-radius:12px;color:#334c9b;font:16px system-ui&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;HTML preview&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Agent layouts keep their styling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\"></iframe></details>\n<p><a href=\"#evidence\">View the checks</a></p>\n<p></p>\n</div></div></article><article class=\"maintenance-message from-user\" data-message=\"u2\"><div class=\"maintenance-message-meta\"><b>Alex</b><time datetime=\"2026-10-01T12:01:00.000Z\">12:01 PM</time></div><div class=\"maintenance-bubble\"><p class=\"maintenance-user-text\">Keep the history after Maintenance goes home.</p></div></article><article class=\"maintenance-message from-agent\" data-message=\"a2\"><div class=\"maintenance-message-meta\"><b>Maintenance</b><time datetime=\"2026-10-01T12:01:05.000Z\">12:01 PM</time></div><div class=\"maintenance-bubble\"><div class=\"md\"><p><strong>Done.</strong> Conversations live in the shared office archive, independently of the worker. The change is on the stack.</p>\n</div></div></article></div><form class=\"maintenance-chat-composer\"><p class=\"maintenance-chat-error hidden\" role=\"alert\"></p><textarea rows=\"2\" maxlength=\"20000\" placeholder=\"Ask Maintenance to build, fix, or explain something\u2026\" aria-label=\"Message to Maintenance\" style=\"\"></textarea><div class=\"maintenance-composer-bottom\"><p class=\"maintenance-composer-note\">Follow-ups wait in the agent\u2019s input box \u00b7 Shift+Enter for a new line</p><button class=\"maintenance-send\" type=\"submit\">Send</button></div></form></section></div></div></div><div class=\"classic hidden\"><h2>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Request / correct Maintenance</h2><p>Classic prompt view. Enable the experiment above to see your saved chat again.</p><textarea placeholder=\"Tell Maintenance what to change, explain, or correct\u2026\"></textarea><p><button id=\"enable\">Try the chat experiment</button></p></div><section class=\"evidence\" id=\"evidence\"><h2>Checked before stacking</h2><div class=\"badges\"><span>\u2713 Typecheck</span><span>\u2713 481 tests</span><span>\u2713 Client + server build</span><span>\u2713 Desktop + mobile browser checks</span></div><p>Verified persistent archive/restart/departure, replay deduplication, partial transcripts, public-message filtering, pagination, Markdown sanitization, HTML isolation, request acknowledgements, rejection recovery, approvals, and settings persistence.</p><p><b>Try it after shipping:</b> enable the experiment, walk to Maintenance, and press E. Review the stack from the header; answer approvals in the terminal.</p><p class=\"demo-note\">Rich replies: Codex and Claude-compatible transcripts. Other providers keep terminal replies. Archived sessions are read-only and shared with the office. HTML previews preserve styling with scripts and network resources disabled.</p></section></main><div class=\"overlay hidden\" id=\"overlay\"><section><button id=\"dismiss\" aria-label=\"Close demo panel\">\u2715</button><h2 id=\"panel-title\"></h2><div id=\"panel-body\"></div></section></div><script>\nconst chat=document.querySelector('.maintenance-chat'),stage=document.querySelector('.stage'),classic=document.querySelector('.classic'),experiment=document.querySelector('#experiment'),list=document.querySelector('.maintenance-chat-messages'),composer=document.querySelector('.maintenance-chat-composer'),input=composer.querySelector('textarea'),note=document.querySelector('.maintenance-composer-note'),archive=document.querySelector('.maintenance-chat-archive'),search=document.querySelector('input[type=search]'),overlay=document.querySelector('#overlay');\nconst live=list.innerHTML;const old='<article class=\"maintenance-message from-user\"><div class=\"maintenance-message-meta\"><b>Alex</b><time>Yesterday</time></div><div class=\"maintenance-bubble\">Fix the Shift hint.</div></article><article class=\"maintenance-message from-agent\"><div class=\"maintenance-message-meta\"><b>Maintenance</b></div><div class=\"maintenance-bubble\"><p><b>Fixed.</b> The hint clears reliably on release and focus changes. It is on the stack.</p></div></article>';let current=live;let archived=false;\nfunction showCurrent(){archived=false;list.innerHTML=current;input.disabled=false;composer.querySelector('button[type=submit]').disabled=false;note.textContent='Enter to send \u00b7 Shift+Enter for a new line \u00b7 demo only';list.scrollTop=0;archive.querySelectorAll('button').forEach((b,i)=>b.classList.toggle('selected',i===0));}\nfunction showOld(){archived=true;list.innerHTML=old;input.disabled=true;composer.querySelector('button[type=submit]').disabled=true;note.textContent='Archived conversation \u00b7 choose Current conversation to send again.';archive.querySelectorAll('button').forEach((b,i)=>b.classList.toggle('selected',i===1));}\narchive.querySelectorAll('button').forEach((b,i)=>b.onclick=i===0?showCurrent:showOld);document.querySelector('.maintenance-current').onclick=showCurrent;search.oninput=()=>archive.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('hidden',!b.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(search.value.toLowerCase())));\nfunction toggle(){stage.classList.toggle('hidden',!experiment.checked);classic.classList.toggle('hidden',experiment.checked)}experiment.onchange=toggle;document.querySelector('#enable').onclick=()=>{experiment.checked=true;toggle()};\nfunction showPanel(title,content){document.querySelector('#panel-title').textContent=title;document.querySelector('#panel-body').innerHTML=content;overlay.classList.remove('hidden')};document.querySelector('#dismiss').onclick=()=>overlay.classList.add('hidden');\nconst tools=document.querySelector('.maintenance-chat-tools');tools.children[0].onclick=()=>showPanel('Review the maintenance stack','<p>Experimental Maintenance chat with a persistent archive.</p><p>One tested commit on the stack. Ship with the closet\u2019s big button when the stack is ready.</p>');tools.children[1].onclick=()=>showPanel('The real terminal remains available','<pre>Maintenance needs your approval.\\n\\nIn the office, Open terminal takes you to its live session.\\nApprove or answer there, then return to chat.</pre>');tools.children[2].onclick=()=>showPanel('Back to the office','<p>Closing the chat returns you to mouse-look. This walkthrough stays on the TV.</p>');\ncomposer.onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();if(archived||!input.value.trim())return;const article=document.createElement('article');article.className='maintenance-message from-user';const meta=document.createElement('div');meta.className='maintenance-message-meta';meta.textContent='You \u00b7 just now';const bubble=document.createElement('div');bubble.className='maintenance-bubble';bubble.textContent=input.value.trim();article.append(meta,bubble);list.append(article);const reply=document.createElement('article');reply.className='maintenance-message from-agent';reply.innerHTML='<div class=\"maintenance-message-meta\"><b>Maintenance</b><span>Demo reply</span></div><div class=\"maintenance-bubble\"><p><b>Request received.</b> In the office, this goes to the real Maintenance worker. The office archives accepted requests and public replies.</p></div>';list.append(reply);input.value='';current=list.innerHTML;list.scrollTop=list.scrollHeight};input.onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'&&!e.shiftKey&&!e.isComposing){e.preventDefault();composer.requestSubmit()}};\nlist.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target.classList.contains('maintenance-copy')){const code=e.target.parentElement.querySelector('code').textContent;if(navigator.clipboard)navigator.clipboard.writeText(code).then(()=>e.target.textContent='Copied',()=>e.target.textContent='Copy unavailable')}});addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape')overlay.classList.add('hidden')});showCurrent();\n</script></html>"}